Cell["Holding options on the system", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"c4429776-af0d-2f41-8ed3-183d801d3b00"],

Cell["\<\
A system can carry the options that describe it, so they are not retyped on \
every call:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7979061f-cdc5-a743-a6f2-14987fc90d32"],

Cell["\<\
strict = HypergraphRewritingSystem[subdivide, Hypergraph[{{1, 2}, {2, 3}}],
  \"CausalDependence\" -> \"Edges\", \"PanelSize\" -> 70];
strict\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"4a1f0cd0-af3f-774a-a80f-0ec50bb29e8a"],

