Cell["\<\
Four pairs by the held option, six when the call overrides it. What is in \
force for a system, the ones it holds and the defaults for the rest:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ff39c5dd-b1c7-5648-82f3-d48213d18cc4"],

Cell["\<\
FilterRules[strict[\"Options\"],
  {\"CausalDependence\", \"PanelSize\", \"MaxDrawnVertices\", \
\"TransitiveReduction\"}]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"61547328-6b67-734d-954a-24ff375246ae"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"CausalDependence\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"Edges\"\>"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"TransitiveReduction\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"MaxDrawnVertices\"\>", "\[Rule]", "24"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"PanelSize\"\>", "\[Rule]", "70"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",Expressi\
onUUID->"99f4b016-c222-e745-8b10-d716db58f74d"],

Cell["\<\
The two-argument form is the same object with no options held:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7fbc4715-ace5-8847-9075-ecf468b0708f"],

Cell["\<\
HypergraphRewritingSystem[subdivide, Hypergraph[{{1, 2}}]] ===
  HypergraphRewritingSystem[subdivide, Hypergraph[{{1, 2}}], {}]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"56a63efc-35a5-ef4c-a11f-7590096cf0fc"],

Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"bd43c990-f71d-b34a-be1c-65fbe78c420b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Design note.  ",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "Options are held on the system rather than only passed to properties \
because there are twelve of them and most describe the system rather than the \
question being asked of it. Which reading of causal dependence a model uses \
is a fact about the model; how many generations to evolve is a fact about the \
question."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{2, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameMargins->{{10, 0}, {6, 6}},
 CellFrameColor->GrayLevel[0.7],
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.25],ExpressionUUID->"d8bba40d-604e-4f42-9063-5765c55a5dae"],

Cell["A labelled system, drawn", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"020ec5ab-00ec-bb41-8057-a29782939c6d"],

Cell["\<\
Nothing about the drawing is particular to unlabelled hypergraphs. The \
composition rule of section 6, with the labels shown:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"76390cad-ef40-8342-ba8a-3e672bc24eb9"],

Cell["\<\
chainSys[\"EvolutionGraph\", 1, ImageSize -> 620, \"PanelSize\" -> 150,
  \"HypergraphPlotOptions\" -> {EdgeLabels -> Automatic, AspectRatio -> \
Automatic}]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"0cb0c9d8-3a0f-2c4a-a005-ceed09fd3c87"],

